OL,3,ARussia-bound ship still on fire after
OL,4,Aattack in Gulf of Finland
OL,5,
OL,6,FRescue and firefighting efforts are
OL,7,Fcontinuing for a Russian cargo vessel
OL,8,Fhit by a drone attack in the eastern
OL,9,FGulf of Finland, authorities have said.
OL,11,FThe ship - the Sparta II - was bound
OL,12,Ffor Russia's Baltic exclave Kaliningrad
OL,13,Fwhen it was hit on Saturday morning,
OL,14,Fbefore drifting into Finnish waters.
OL,15,FFinnish defence forces said Ukraine was
OL,16,Flikely behind the attack. Kyiv has yet
OL,17,Fto comment.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
