OL,3,ARussia-bound ship still on fire after
OL,4,Aattack in Gulf of Finland
OL,5,
OL,6,FFinland's Border Guard said on Sunday
OL,7,Fthat work was ongoing to make sure the
OL,8,Fcargo ship did not sink but it was not
OL,9,Faware of any danger to surrounding
OL,10,Fmaritime traffic.
OL,12,FWater was still being used to douse the
OL,13,Fship on Sunday, and Finland said
OL,14,FEstonian and Russian assets were also
OL,15,Finvolved in recovery work.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
